   $q$Listen. Marisol's neighbor had a big, fluffy dog named Bear. At first, Marisol hid behind the gate whenever Bear barked. One day, the neighbor said, Bear is gentle. Hold out your hand. Marisol held out a shaky hand, and Bear sniffed it and licked it softly. Marisol giggled. Now Marisol visits Bear every day and throws a ball for Bear to catch. How did Marisol change? Tap the answer.$q$, $q$[{"text":"brave to scared","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"brave to scared"}},{"text":"scared to brave","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"scared to brave"}},{"text":"happy to mad","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"happy to mad"}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$scared to brave$q$, $q$At first, Marisol hid from Bear. By the end, Marisol visits Bear every day. Marisol changed from scared to brave.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
