   $q$Listen. Yusuf had a big part in the class play. Yusuf was going to be the king. On the night of the show, Yusuf walked onto the stage, looked out at all the people and forgot the words! Yusuf's face got hot. Then Yusuf remembered the little card tucked inside the crown. Yusuf peeked at it, took a breath and said every line. What did Yusuf do when the words were gone? Tap the answer.$q$, $q$[{"text":"peeked at a card","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"peeked at a card"}},{"text":"sang a song","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"sang a song"}},{"text":"ran off the stage","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"ran off the stage"}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$peeked at a card$q$, $q$When Yusuf forgot the words, Yusuf peeked at the card inside the crown. Then Yusuf said every line.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
