   $q$Listen. Ines wanted to learn to tie shoes. Every night after dinner, Ines sat on the stairs and practiced with Grandpa. Make a loop, wrap it around and pull it through, Grandpa said. For a long time, the laces kept falling apart. Then one morning before school, Ines tied both shoes all alone. Ines stood up tall and showed everyone in the family. How did Ines feel at the end? Tap the answer.$q$, $q$[{"text":"bored","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"bored"}},{"text":"proud","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"proud"}},{"text":"scared","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"scared"}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$proud$q$, $q$After lots of practice, Ines tied both shoes alone, stood up tall and showed the family. Ines felt proud.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
