   $q$Listen. At the park, Bao and Bao's sister, Lin, both ran to the same swing. I was here first! said Bao. No, I was! said Lin. They both held on to the chains and pulled. Then Lin had an idea. Let's count to fifty, then switch. Bao nodded. They counted together, swung, and switched, again and again, until it was time to go home. How did Bao and Lin fix their problem? Tap the answer.$q$, $q$[{"text":"they took turns","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"they took turns"}},{"text":"they broke it","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"they broke it"}},{"text":"they went home","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"they went home"}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$they took turns$q$, $q$Lin said to count to fifty and then switch. Bao and Lin took turns on the swing until it was time to go home.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
