   $q$Listen. Femi was racing down the sidewalk on a new scooter. The front wheel hit a bump, and Femi tumbled onto the grass. Femi's knee was scraped, and it stung. Mom put on a bandage. Femi sat for a minute and wiped away a tear. Then Femi stood up, picked up the scooter and said, I want to try again. This time Femi went slowly over the bump. What did Femi do after falling? Tap the answer.$q$, $q$[{"text":"gave up","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"gave up"}},{"text":"tried again","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"tried again"}},{"text":"went to bed","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"went to bed"}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$tried again$q$, $q$After a bandage and a short rest, Femi picked up the scooter and tried again, going slowly over the bump.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
