   $q$Listen. On the first day at a new school, Emre did not know anyone. At recess, Emre sat alone on a bench and looked at the ground. Emre missed the old school and old friends. Then a girl named Rosie walked over with a jump rope. Want to play? Rosie asked. Emre nodded, and soon they were jumping and laughing together. How did Emre feel at the beginning of the story? Tap the picture.$q$, $q$[{"text":"sad","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"face_sad","count":1}},{"text":"happy","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"face_happy","count":1}},{"text":"mad","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"face_mad","count":1}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$sad$q$, $q$At the beginning, Emre sat alone, looked at the ground and missed old friends. Emre felt sad. Later, playing with Rosie made Emre happy.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
