   $q$Listen. It was Grandma's birthday, and the whole family was coming for dinner. That morning, Joaquin remembered that there was no gift for Grandma. There was no time to go to the store. Joaquin did not panic. Joaquin got out paper, crayons and glue. Joaquin folded the paper and drew a bunch of flowers on the front. Inside, Joaquin wrote, I love you, Grandma. What did Joaquin make? Tap the answer.$q$, $q$[{"text":"a hat","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"a hat"}},{"text":"a card","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"a card"}},{"text":"a cake","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"a cake"}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$a card$q$, $q$With no gift and no time to shop, Joaquin used paper, crayons and glue to make a birthday card for Grandma.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
