   $q$Listen. One windy night, Halle was reading in bed when all the lights went out. The room was pitch black and very quiet. Halle pulled the blanket up and called, Mom! Mom came in with a little lamp that runs on batteries and set it on the table. The room filled with a soft glow. Halle let go of the blanket and smiled. Why did Halle stop feeling scared? Tap the answer.$q$, $q$[{"text":"Mom lit a lamp","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Mom lit a lamp"}},{"text":"Halle fell asleep","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Halle fell asleep"}},{"text":"the wind got loud","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"the wind got loud"}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Mom lit a lamp$q$, $q$Mom brought a lamp that runs on batteries, and the room filled with a soft glow. With the light on, Halle let go of the blanket and smiled.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
