   $q$Listen. Zane's soccer team played hard, but the other team won the game. Zane felt sad and kicked at the grass. Coach Ada said, You all played your best. Now let's be good sports. Zane took a deep breath and walked over to the other team. Zane shook hands with each player and said, Good game. On the way home, Zane was already planning to practice more. What did Zane do after the game? Tap the answer.$q$, $q$[{"text":"yelled at them","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"yelled at them"}},{"text":"threw the ball","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"threw the ball"}},{"text":"shook hands","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"shook hands"}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$shook hands$q$, $q$Coach Ada asked the team to be good sports, so Zane walked over and shook hands with each player.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
