   $q$Listen. Early in the morning, the second grade class climbed onto a yellow bus. The bus rolled along the bumpy country road for a long time. The kids sang songs and looked out the windows at fields and cows. At last, the bus stopped at a big red barn. The farmer showed them baby goats, and everyone got to pet one. Where are the kids at the beginning of the story? Tap the picture.$q$, $q$[{"text":"bus","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"bus","count":1}},{"text":"boat","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"boat","count":1}},{"text":"barn","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"barn","count":1}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$bus$q$, $q$The story begins with the class climbing onto a yellow bus. The barn comes later, when the bus stops at the farm.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
