   $q$Listen. Nalani had one giant cookie in a lunch bag. On the way to the picnic table, Nalani tripped, and the cookie broke into four pieces. Nalani looked at the pieces and thought for a moment. Then Nalani gave one piece each to three friends and kept one. Everyone munched and smiled. Breaking it was the best thing that could happen! Nalani laughed. How did Nalani feel at the end? Tap the picture.$q$, $q$[{"text":"sad","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"face_sad","count":1}},{"text":"happy","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"face_happy","count":1}},{"text":"scared","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"face_scared","count":1}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$happy$q$, $q$Nalani shared the pieces, everyone smiled, and Nalani laughed. At the end, Nalani felt happy.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
