   $q$Listen. Gus did not like reading. Books are boring, Gus said, and pushed them away. One rainy day, Gus's uncle brought home a book about whales. It had giant pictures of whales leaping out of the sea. Gus looked at one page, then another, and another. That night, Gus read the whole book with a flashlight. Now Gus asks for a new book every week. How did Gus change? Tap the answer.$q$, $q$[{"text":"now loves books","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"now loves books"}},{"text":"got a pet whale","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"got a pet whale"}},{"text":"stopped reading","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"stopped reading"}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$now loves books$q$, $q$At first, Gus said books were boring. After the whale book, Gus read every page and now asks for a new book each week. Gus changed and now loves books.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
